# Python (new code only)

New helpers and tests in this fork: **uv**, **Python 3.14**, direct dependencies pinned with exact `==`, commit `uv.lock`. No bare `pip install`. No version ranges (`>=` / `~=`).

Do **not** migrate `overlay/` (PyQt6 radial menu, GTK4/libadwaita settings via distro `python-pyqt6` / `python-gobject`) to uv unless the user explicitly asks. Those stay on system packages.
